# Force LF everywhere. CRLF breaks shell scripts and entrypoints inside Linux containers (Windows checkouts).
# These rules win over core.autocrlf on the learner's machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
bin/* text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
